/Title (Muscle memory Muscle memory develops through correct repetition. Repeating the same mistake at high speed also  reinforces a pattern, so deliberate practice matters. When a key combination causes trouble, slow it down,  type it correctly several times, then gradually return to normal speed.)
/Dest [14 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 487 0 R
/Prev 502 0 R
>>
